58:["$","p",null,{"className":"np-fest-desc","children":"The city's greatest street festival. A wooden chariot is pulled through lanes, masked Lakhe and Pulukisi dance, the great bhairav drums sound all night, and the living goddess Kumari is carried in her ratha to bless the city."}]
